# gnuplot: gnuplot 5.4 documentation: commands and expressions; requirements/languages/gnuplot.md
name     gnuplot gp gnu
keyword  plot splot replot set unset show reset print load call if else do for while fit using with
keyword  title notitle lines points linespoints boxes errorbars axes every index smooth
builtin  sin cos tan exp log sqrt abs pi x y terminal output xlabel ylabel xrange yrange grid key
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : doubled
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~
calls
